{"version":1,"content":"<p>西貢沙角尾村昨晚(22日)發生停電事故。</p><p>昨晚7時許，上址有地底電纜疑老化損壞冒煙，約50村屋一度停電，約90名居民受影響。</p><p>中電接報後隨即派員到場搶修，並安排臨時電纜為居民供電，於午夜前完成搶修回復供電。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T04:24:07.202934+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:41:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:44.270312+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:19.572266+00:00","content_hash":"f0a3b95c345a2765ebd3ab04bb09ece83e87dac9f85942a283aed9b21d4d5bfd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}